Subject: [PATCH] m5stack: implement chip-native board power lifecycle

AXP192/AXP2101 and M5PM1 power/control registers own shutdown and
reset effects. PWRON timing follows each chip configuration. Plus2
retention follows its real GPIO4 and explicit USB supply, not a key
long-press frontend shortcut. StackChan VM_EN resolves the IOE driver
and configured pulls. Dynamic PM1 boot-strap download remains an
explicit observable model gap.

Based on native42; apply after the StackChan servo power callback patch.
Sources: M5Unified 8530f5377d782e4a25a6c482de2e71c3f75ca8eb;
M5Stack M5PM1 manual and Plus2 schematic; AXP2101 datasheet.

